# Research
uplink-research-analyzer-name = Research Analyzer
uplink-research-analyzer-desc = A simple device that scans high value objects to determine what is required to research them.

uplink-syndicate-tactical-laser-name = Tactical Laser Pistol
uplink-syndicate-tactical-laser-desc = A sleek, high quality laser pistol that fires off high powered laser beams. Powers itself off of standard cells for ease of use. Comes preloaded with a Hyper Capacity cell.

uplink-teleportation-relay-name = Teleportation Relay
uplink-teleportation-relay-desc = A crudely made teleporting device that allows the user to momentarily phase out of the real world to travel to any location they desire in a short distance. Has a cooldown between uses.

uplink-clothing-shoes-boots-mag-syndie-advanced-name = Advanced Blood-Red Magboots
uplink-clothing-shoes-boots-mag-syndie-advanced-desc = A strict upgrade from the existing Blood-Red Magboots. These Magboots are much more advanced, featuring no slowdown, resistance to Stamina damage, and injury slowdown reduction.

uplink-access-hijacker-name = Access Hijacker
uplink-access-hijacker-desc = A unique device similar to that of the Emag and Authentication Disruptor. Use this on an item that is locked behind access, and it will covertly add the Syndicate Access to the device, allowing for easy and mostly stealthy infiltration. Hard to remove too!

uplink-clothing-outer-hardsuit-ultima-name = Cybersun Ultima Hardsuit
uplink-clothing-outer-hardsuit-ultima-desc = Cybersun's most advanced suit yet! It is capable of a variety of self-destructs, allowing the user to activate a localized EMP, Flashbang, or Blast Explosion directly from the suit. While not stellar in Combat, this unique feature would certainly make up for it. Extremely explosive resistant and Rad-Proofed.
